---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Thumb from '../components/Thumb.astro';
---

<Layout title="The Rabbi" description="Rabbi Joseph Dweck teaches and writes on contemporary Orthodox Jewish thought, drawing from the classical Sephardi tradition.">

  <section class="page-hero">
    <h1>The Rabbi</h1>
    <div class="gold-rule"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container bio-layout">
      <div class="bio-image">
        <img src="/images/GK5StT7XMAA8fJB.avif" alt="Rabbi Joseph Dweck" />
      </div>
      <div class="bio-text">
        <h2 class="section-title">Rabbi Joseph Dweck</h2>
        <div class="gold-divider"></div>
        <p>
          Rabbi Joseph Dweck teaches and writes on contemporary Orthodox Jewish thought, drawing from the
          classical Sephardi tradition and presenting Torah&rsquo;s ancient wisdom in modern, pragmatic, and
          meaningful ways.
        </p>
        <p>
          From 2013 to 2025 he served as Senior Rabbi of the S&amp;P Sephardi Community of the UK, the
          country&rsquo;s oldest Jewish community (founded in 1656), where he oversaw the Sephardi Beth Din and
          the Sephardi Kashrut Authority. During this period he also held senior positions at the London School
          of Jewish Studies, the Council of Christians and Jews, the Board of Deputies of British Jews, and the
          Conference of European Rabbis. He is the Rosh Bet Midrash of The Ḥabura and holds the Rabbi Levy
          Chair of Jewish Wisdom at LSJS.
        </p>
        <p>
          Educated at Yeshiva Hazon Ovadia in Jerusalem under former Sephardi Chief Rabbi Ovadia Yosef
          z&rdquo;l, Rabbi Dweck received rabbinic ordination through the Sephardic Rabbinical College of
          Brooklyn. He holds an MA in Jewish Education and trained as a psychotherapist at Regent&rsquo;s
          University London. He previously served as rabbi of Congregation Sha&rsquo;are Shalom in Brooklyn
          (1999&ndash;2013) and as Rosh Yeshiva and Head of School at Barkai Yeshiva (2007&ndash;2013).
        </p>
        <p>
          In 2026, Rabbi Dweck moved to Israel with his family and continues to teach internationally while
          maintaining an active presence on digital and social media platforms.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Learn with Rabbi Dweck</h2>
      <div class="gold-divider"></div>
      <div class="edu-grid">
        <a href="/parasha" class="edu-item">
          <div class="edu-thumb"><Thumb title="The Parasha" he="פרשה" /></div>
          <h3>The Parasha</h3>
          <p>Weekly Torah commentary</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/perspectives" class="edu-item">
          <div class="edu-thumb"><Thumb title="Perspectives" he="השקפה" tone="gold" /></div>
          <h3>Perspectives</h3>
          <p>Bite-size video meditations</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/writings" class="edu-item">
          <div class="edu-thumb"><Thumb title="Writings" he="כתבים" tone="parchment" /></div>
          <h3>Writings</h3>
          <p>Essays &amp; Substack</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .bio-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.6fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .bio-image img {
    width: 100%;
    border-top: 4px solid var(--gold);
    box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 var(--cream-dark);
  }
  .bio-text p { margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.8; }

  .roles-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .role-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--cream-dark);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--gold);
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .role-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .role-card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .role-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-light); }

  .edu-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .edu-item {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .edu-item:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .edu-item img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 200px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .edu-item h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .edu-item p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-light); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .bio-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .edu-thumb { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; }
</style>
